//! Interactive `eframe` / `egui` desktop workbench (`sar-atlas gui`, `v3.8.0`) featuring a native
//! top menu bar, 5-domain categorized navigation ribbon, `Ctrl+K` fuzzy module/compound command
//! palette, collapsible left/right side panels + `F11` Zen mode, grouped inspector menus, and 39 tabs:
//! 1. `SALI Cliff Viewport` (3-pass instanced `wgpu` chemical-space renderer + cliff table)
//! 2. `2D Structure Grid` (custom Kekulé skeletal vector painter + SMARTS & PAINS halos)
//! 3. `Bemis-Murcko Scaffolds` (series potency spread & one-click scaffold -> SAR Matrix solve)
//! 4. `Matched Molecular Pairs` (Hussain-Rea R-group transforms + side-by-side 2D pair diff)
//! 5. `SAR Matrix (Free-Wilson)` (core-aligned R1/R2/R3 Ridge QSAR, 2D pivot grid & virtual analogs)
//! 6. `2D Sketcher (Live Lab)` (interactive bond/atom/ring/R-group editor recomputing QED, CNS-MPO,
//!    ADMET, PAINS, Free-Wilson pAct, and nearest ECFP4/SALI cliffs live as you edit)
//! 7. `ADMET & BOILED-Egg` (Daina-Zoete GI/BBB ellipses, P-gp efflux, Delaney ESOL LogS, 3/75 & hERG)
//! 8. `Bioisostere Generator` (Meanwell 2011 tactical bioisostere & late-stage analog enumerator)
//! 9. `ChEMBL / DB Studio` (live EMBL-EBI ChEMBL & NCBI PubChem REST importers + `.sqlite` / `.json` workspace store)
//! 10. `Pharmacophore` (2D topological HBD/HBA/AROM/HYD/POS/NEG mapper, 3-point Gobbi distance triangles & scaffold hopping)
//! 11. `Synth & BRICS` (Ertl & Schuffenhauer 2009 `SAScore` breakdown + Degen et al. 2008 `BRICS` retrosynthetic disconnector)
//! 12. `BRICS Hybrids` (combinatorial cross-lead `BRICS` fragment recombiner scored by `Free-Wilson pAct`, `QED` & `SAScore`)
//! 13. `MCS & 2D Align` (McGregor/`VF2` Maximum Common Substructure core detector + 2D Procrustes series R-group aligner)
//! 14. `pKa & Protomers` (physiological `pH 7.4` Hammett/Taft micro-`pKa` perception, `pH 0-14` coupled protomer speciation & `logD(pH)` curves, and `MolVS` 2D tautomer enumerator)
//! 15. `3D Shape & ROCS` (Distance-Geometry 3D conformer generator, `MMFF-lite` minimizer, Gasteiger `ESP`, Sauer-Schwarz `NPR` 3D triangle, and `USR`/`ROCS` 3D shape-electrostatic trackball overlay)
//! 16. `Covalent Warheads` (Flanagan `GSH t_1/2` reactivity profiler, two-step `k_inact / K_I` occupancy vs `GSH` kinetic plotter, and 12-warhead reversible/irreversible swapper)
//! 17. `PROTAC & bRo5` (`CRBN`/`VHL` E3 ligase recruiters, solvent-exposed exit-vector 10-linker enumerator, Caron/Ermondi `dIMHB`/`ePSA` chameleonicity & `AB-MPS` map, and Douglass 3-body Hook-Effect plotter)
//! 18. `CYP & Metabolites` (`SMARTCyp` `3A4`/`2D6`/`2C9` regioselective Site-of-Metabolism mapper, LC-HRMS mass-shift spectrum, soft-spot blocking advisor, and Phase I/II `UGT`/`SULT` metabolite enumerator)
//! 19. `Macrocyclizer` (3D-guided peripheral terminal-pair finder, 10-tether `RCM` alkene/alkane & macrolactam/`N`-Me-lactam/diether/`CuAAC` enumerator, Kier `Phi`, and 3D preorganization `-T*dS_conf` + Kabsch Core-RMSD studio)
//! 20. `Fragment Grower` (`Rule-of-3` fragment exit-vector mapper, 6 clinical `FBDD` seeds, deconstruct-to-`Ro3` core extractor, 16 poised synthons, iterative seed promotion, and `GE`/`LLE`/`LE`/`SILE` optimizer)
//! 21. `Prodrug Studio` (`BCS Class I–IV` solubility/permeability diagnosis, maskable handle mapper, 20 `Ester` / `Phosphate` / `Carbamate` / `Oxazolidinone` / `PEPT1` promoieties, and `CES1`/`CES2`/`ALP`/`BPHL` oral PK bioconversion profiler)
//! 22. `Oral PBPK & Kp,uu` (7-segment `CAT`/`ACAT` GI absorption, `Q_gut` + `Well-Stirred` hepatic first-pass `Fa * Fg * Fh`, `Rodgers-Rowland` organ `Kp`/`Vss`, and `RK4` unbound plasma `Cu,p(t)` vs unbound brain `Cu,brain(t)` `Kp,uu,brain` simulator)
//! 23. `Lead Dossier & HTML` (cross-module 6-pillar `Derringer-Suich` desirability radar, 12-criterion Stage-Gate `TPP` scorecard, campaign leaderboard, and standalone `.html`/`.svg` medicinal-chemistry dossier exporter)
//! 24. `De Novo Evolution` (`GB-GA`/`CReM` graph mutations, `BCP`/`sp3`/heterocycle ring hops, and `BRICS` synthon crossovers guided by 3D `ROCS`, 2D `Gobbi` pharmacophores, `LE`/`LLE`, and Ertl `SAScore`)
//! 25. `PDB Pocket & Waters` (structure-based `.pdb` binding-site cavity & `DScore` mapper, `WaterMap` unhappy vs structural water profiler, receptor 3D pharmacophore extractor, and `Vina`-style pocket complementarity scorer)
//! 26. `DEL & Parallel Lib` (2- and 3-step `Amide`, `Suzuki-Miyaura`, `Buchwald-Hartwig`, and `CuAAC Click` DNA-encoded / parallel library enumerator with `MaxMin` `ECFP4` diversity & 3D `PDB Pocket` / `ROCS` pre-filtering)
//! 27. `Selectivity & Mut ddG` (dual-pocket target vs off-target 3D cavity sub-pocket mapper, differential `WaterMap` hydration analyzer, and single-point binding-site residue-mutation `Delta-Delta G` resistance/paralog profiler)
//! 28. `Cryptic & Allostery` (`GNM`/`ANM` normal-mode cryptic pocket detector, `DCCM` cross-correlation & hinge mapper, Dijkstra allosteric pathway tracer, and allosteric-to-orthosteric mechanical strain & `MWC` cooperativity scorer)
//! 29. `Active-Learn QSAR` (`ECFP4` Tanimoto + `3D-USRCAT` Cholesky `GP` & `24`-tree `RF` ensemble QSAR with conformal `90%` intervals, `EI`/`UCB` acquisition, and Kriging-Believer batch selection)
//! 30. `Lomap RBFE & BAR` (`Lomap` `MCS` biconnected perturbation-graph planner, multi-`lambda` `Zwanzig`/`Bennett BAR` 2-leg `RBFE` estimator, `3`/`4`-cycle hysteresis detector, and `MLE` node reconciler)
//! 31. `Torsion & Rotor Lock` (`CSD`/`SMARTS` `360 deg` `1D` dihedral energy scanner, `Shoichet` `TEU` bioactive 3D conformer strain estimator, and `ortho`-Me / `IMHB` / small-ring rotatable-bond locking studio)
//! 32. `Discovery Funnel` (configurable 6-stage molecule discovery cascade: `Pool Expansion -> PAINS/ADMET/SAScore -> 3D Pocket & Shoichet TEU -> Selectivity -> Active-Learning QSAR -> Lomap RBFE` + 1-click live dataset survivor promotion)
//! 33. `Fragment Linker` (`DeLinker` 4-DOF 3D sub-pocket exit-vector aligner, `18`-scaffold linker & direct-merge matcher, `Kabsch` `Core-RMSD` pose-preservation scorer, and `Jencks`/`Murray-Verdonk` super-additivity `Delta-G` studio)
//! 34. `Induced-Fit & Ensemble` (`Sherman IFD` / `AutoDockFR` flexible binding-pocket `Dunbrack` side-chain rotamer repacker & 5-state `Fischer-Shoichet` Boltzmann receptor-ensemble scorer)
//! 35. `H-Bond & Bridge Water` (`Protoss`/`Reduce` coupled `His`/`Asp`/`Glu` tautomer/protonation, `180 deg` `Asn`/`Gln`/`His` flip, and tetrahedral `H-O-H` bridge-water H-bond network optimizer)
//! 36. `WaterMap & R-Vectors` (`IFST` / `WaterMap` / `GIST` `dH`/`-TdS`/`dG` active-site hydration hotspot mapper & exit-vector matched displaceable-water R-group designer)
//! 37. `Foldit 3D Sculpt & Puzzles` (`Foldit`/`Drugit`/`ISOLDE` interactive 3D tactile ligand & side-chain force-field sculptor, rubber-band H-bond restraints, `Wiggle`/`Shake`/`Blue-Fuse`, and timed med-chem challenge puzzles)
//! 38. `Public PDB & AFDB Fetch` (Live `RCSB PDB` & `EMBL-EBI AlphaFold DB` coordinate, co-crystal ligand `SMILES`, per-residue `pLDDT`/`PAE` confidence, loop-trimming sanitizer, and `Karelina-Dror` pocket readiness studio)
//! 39. `3D ESP & Sigma-Hole` (`Bauer-Mackey` Connolly surface electrostatic complementarity, `XED` off-nucleus `sigma-hole` halogen/chalcogen bonds, and `Wheeler-Houk` / `Gallivan-Dougherty` `pi`-multipole studio)

